From a18c64ea5bdf0f7b03148d5ea847223390b6b25f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GrgaPalcic <26028466+GrgaPalcic@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:30:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] glm cuda: TF_KV_SHARE keeps GLM's prompts as the pool's pages

Ported from upstream a6f5615d4, 768170532, d5b0b92f4 and adapted to this recipe's snapshot layout. A kept state's copy and its plan leave the shared store's pages out; the lanes adopt the store's pages at the head of a lease; the store sits over rank 0's pages; combinations not yet supported are refused by name at startup. With TF_KV_SHARE unset every path is unchanged.
